{"who":"Hannah","text":"I can't believe you actually think that. After everything Mum went through.","posted":true,"at":"2026-11-27T18:15","checkin":"2026-11-27T18:15"}
{"who":"Hannah","text":"You know what she told us. You were there.","posted":true,"at":"2026-11-27T18:16","checkin":"2026-11-27T18:16"}
{"who":"Michael","text":"Hannah we've been through this","posted":true,"at":"2026-11-27T18:34","checkin":"2026-11-27T18:34"}
{"who":"Hannah","text":"No we haven't. You just shut it down every time like it doesn't matter.","posted":true,"at":"2026-11-27T18:35","checkin":"2026-11-27T18:35"}
{"who":"Michael","text":"bc it doesn't matter what I think, you've already decided I'm a bad person","posted":true,"at":"2026-11-27T18:35","checkin":"2026-11-27T18:35"}
{"who":"Hannah","text":"That's not what this is about. This is about you not giving a shit about women. About us.","posted":true,"at":"2026-11-27T18:37","checkin":"2026-11-27T18:37"}
{"who":"Michael","text":"That's not fair and you know it","posted":true,"at":"2026-11-27T18:38","checkin":"2026-11-27T18:38"}
{"who":"Hannah","text":"Is it not. You vote for them. You defend them.","posted":true,"at":"2026-11-27T18:39","checkin":"2026-11-27T18:39"}
{"who":"Hannah","text":"Mum couldn't tell Dad. She was terrified. And you're out here acting like it's some abstract thing.","posted":true,"at":"2026-11-27T18:40","checkin":"2026-11-27T18:40"}
{"who":"Michael","text":"I'm not acting like anything. I just think there's more to it than—","posted":true,"at":"2026-11-27T19:02","checkin":"2026-11-27T19:02"}
{"who":"Hannah","text":"There's nothing more to it. There's her life or not her life. Her choice or not her choice.","posted":true,"at":"2026-11-27T19:03","checkin":"2026-11-27T19:03"}
{"who":"Michael","text":"I know what you mean I'm just saying the other side has a point too","posted":true,"at":"2026-11-27T19:04","checkin":"2026-11-27T19:04"}
{"who":"Hannah","text":"Oh my god.","posted":true,"at":"2026-11-27T19:05","checkin":"2026-11-27T19:05"}
{"who":"Hannah","text":"The other side has a point.","posted":true,"at":"2026-11-27T19:05","checkin":"2026-11-27T19:05"}
{"who":"Michael","text":"They do though? People genuinely believe—","posted":true,"at":"2026-11-27T19:06","checkin":"2026-11-27T19:06"}
{"who":"Hannah","text":"I don't care what they believe. I care that my brother won't even back his own family.","posted":true,"at":"2026-11-27T19:08","checkin":"2026-11-27T19:08"}
{"who":"Michael","text":"That's bollocks","posted":true,"at":"2026-11-27T19:09","checkin":"2026-11-27T19:09"}
{"who":"Hannah","text":"Is it. Because from where I'm sitting it looks like you've decided you're better than us. Better than Mum. Better than me.","posted":true,"at":"2026-11-27T19:10","checkin":"2026-11-27T19:10"}
{"who":"Michael","text":"When did I ever say that","posted":true,"at":"2026-11-27T19:11","checkin":"2026-11-27T19:11"}
{"who":"Hannah","text":"You don't have to say it. You say it every time you won't just admit that women need this.","posted":true,"at":"2026-11-27T19:12","checkin":"2026-11-27T19:12"}
{"who":"Michael","text":"I'm not doing this rn","posted":true,"at":"2026-11-27T19:30","checkin":"2026-11-27T19:30"}
{"who":"Hannah","text":"Of course you're not. You never do.","posted":true,"at":"2026-11-27T19:31","checkin":"2026-11-27T19:31"}
{"who":"Hannah","text":"You just disappear and then in a few weeks you act like it never happened.","posted":true,"at":"2026-11-27T19:31","checkin":"2026-11-27T19:31"}
{"who":"Michael","text":"Because nothing gets resolved. We just go in circles.","posted":true,"at":"2026-11-27T19:32","checkin":"2026-11-27T19:32"}
{"who":"Hannah","text":"Nothing gets resolved because you won't actually engage. You just say \"both sides\" like you're being so reasonable.","posted":true,"at":"2026-11-27T19:33","checkin":"2026-11-27T19:33"}
{"who":"Hannah","text":"You sound like Dad.","posted":true,"at":"2026-11-27T19:34","checkin":"2026-11-27T19:34"}
{"who":"Michael","text":"Don't do that","posted":true,"at":"2026-11-27T19:36","checkin":"2026-11-27T19:36"}
{"who":"Hannah","text":"Why not. It's true.","posted":true,"at":"2026-11-27T19:36","checkin":"2026-11-27T19:36"}
{"who":"Michael","text":"Because it's not and you know it","posted":true,"at":"2026-11-27T19:37","checkin":"2026-11-27T19:37"}
{"who":"Hannah","text":"I don't know anything anymore. I don't know my own brother.","posted":true,"at":"2026-11-27T19:39","checkin":"2026-11-27T19:39"}
{"who":"Michael","text":"Look, I didn't vote for the ban. I didn't want it to happen.","posted":true,"at":"2026-11-27T20:14","checkin":"2026-11-27T20:14"}
{"who":"Hannah","text":"But?","posted":true,"at":"2026-11-27T20:14","checkin":"2026-11-27T20:14"}
{"who":"Michael","text":"There's no but. I'm just saying I'm not the enemy here.","posted":true,"at":"2026-11-27T20:15","checkin":"2026-11-27T20:15"}
{"who":"Hannah","text":"You vote for people who made me have to have this conversation with you in 2026. That makes you complicit whether you like it or not.","posted":true,"at":"2026-11-27T20:17","checkin":"2026-11-27T20:17"}
{"who":"Michael","text":"I vote for a lot of reasons. It's not that simple.","posted":true,"at":"2026-11-27T20:18","checkin":"2026-11-27T20:18"}
{"who":"Hannah","text":"It actually is that simple. You just don't want it to be.","posted":true,"at":"2026-11-27T20:19","checkin":"2026-11-27T20:19"}
{"who":"Michael","text":"And you don't want to hear that I might have a different view on some things without thinking I'm a bad person","posted":true,"at":"2026-11-27T20:20","checkin":"2026-11-27T20:20"}
