{"who":"Hannah","text":"I don't care about fair. I care about you actually standing with your family instead of splitting the difference.","posted":true,"at":"2026-11-27T20:23","checkin":"2026-11-27T20:23"}
{"who":"Michael","text":"I am with my family","posted":true,"at":"2026-11-27T20:24","checkin":"2026-11-27T20:24"}
{"who":"Hannah","text":"You're not. You're with them.","posted":true,"at":"2026-11-27T20:25","checkin":"2026-11-27T20:25"}
{"who":"Michael","text":"I really don't think this is helping","posted":true,"at":"2026-11-27T20:38","checkin":"2026-11-27T20:38"}
{"who":"Hannah","text":"No. It's not. And I'm done.","posted":true,"at":"2026-11-27T20:38","checkin":"2026-11-27T20:38"}
{"who":"Hannah","text":"I'm actually done, Michael.","posted":true,"at":"2026-11-27T20:39","checkin":"2026-11-27T20:39"}
{"who":"Michael","text":"Hannah please don't do this","posted":true,"at":"2026-11-27T21:04","checkin":"2026-11-27T21:04"}
{"who":"Hannah","text":"Do what. Tell you the truth.","posted":true,"at":"2026-11-27T21:05","checkin":"2026-11-27T21:05"}
