{"who":"Hannah","text":"Please just leave it","posted":true,"at":"2026-11-28T21:50","checkin":"2026-11-28T21:50"}
{"who":"Michael","text":"Yeah ok","posted":true,"at":"2026-11-28T21:51","checkin":"2026-11-28T21:51"}
{"who":"Michael","text":"Just so you know I do care. About you I mean. About what you think","posted":true,"at":"2026-11-29T00:14","checkin":"2026-11-29T00:14"}
{"who":"Michael","text":"Even when we don't agree on stuff","posted":true,"at":"2026-11-29T00:15","checkin":"2026-11-29T00:15"}
{"who":"Hannah","text":"I know you do","posted":true,"at":"2026-11-29T00:22","checkin":"2026-11-29T00:22"}
